          "text": "Description: Recent testimony (on May 14, 2008) of an old observation. In May or June 1974 or 1975, a witness observed, from their 5th-floor apartment, three fixed bright points at an altitude of approximately 200 to 300 meters. After several minutes and without noise, these bright points approached the coast and then moved away to the South. No other testimony or additional details were gathered about this phenomenon.",
